.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Acacia serves the Order of Chaos, a group bent on
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]reviving ancient magic to usher in an age of
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]discord. Alongside her partner Saspar she carries
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]out whatever the Order asks, armed with witchcraft
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and a retinue of demons. The Order's goals mean
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]little to her, though: she's devoted to Saspar, and
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]serves Chaos only because he does, hoping one
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]day to be more to him than a partner.
.CP
.SH
\&Acacia: Attacks
.PP
\&Lock Heaven's Door: A stroke of her finger saps the target's energy and fills them with dread.
.PP
\&Devil's Breath: A chilling breath clouds the target's mind.
.SH
\&Acacia: Character Hooks
.PP
\&The Order of Chaos makes Acacia and Saspar natural enemies for anyone defending the world from evil -- Fukiko and Auren, whose backgrounds both feature a vague darkness to be fought, fit especially well. They can also serve as magical rivals.
.SP p1
