\f[NSR]\s[8]**Sazza and Fraz**, twin lesser demons of mischief
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]in Acacia's service, always appear together. Alone,
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]each is feeble; as a pair they hit startlingly hard.
