.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]**High Fructo Cezar**, another of Acacia's
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]demons, once held real power, until a single act of
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]kindness cost him his rank and sealed away most
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]of his strength. He resents it, but he stays mostly
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]loyal to Acacia.
